This repository contains the TEAM VROCK website for https://www.vrock.ch.

The site uses `team-vrock/jekyll-theme-vrock@affa9e6a1e3da6b99a683a359de33712086f57aa` during the refresh work. GitHub project cards are pinned in `_config.yml` and can be enriched into `_data/github_projects.yml` during the GitHub Actions build.
